pgdog (0.1.57-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgrade to upstream 0.1.57 and update the pinned SCRAM source.
  * Preserve deterministic source identity and automatic debug symbols.
  * Clear parent make arguments before Cargo starts jemalloc's nested make.
  * Use vendored string helpers when glibc lacks strlcpy and strlcat.

