pgdog (0.1.56-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgrade to the official upstream 0.1.56 release.
  * Freeze pg_raw_parse, libpg_query, and scram in a deterministic vendor tar.
  * Preserve tokio_unstable and ARM64 LSE without requiring the mold linker.
  * Record the plugin ABI 0.4 and removed manual-query/fingerprint migration.

